#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:39
#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:52
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Popis"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:40
msgid ""
"The limiter prevents an input signal from rising over a desired threshold. "
"This limiter uses lookahead technology to prevent your signal from "
"distorting. It means that there is a small delay after the signal is "
"processed. Keep in mind that the delay it produces is the attack time you "
"set."
msgstr ""
"Obmedzovač zabraňuje vstupnému signálu stúpnuť nad požadovanú prahovú "
"hodnotu. Tento obmedzovač používa technológiu predbežného pohľadu na "
"zabránenie skresleniu signálu. Znamená to, že po spracovaní signálu je malé "
"oneskorenie. Majte na pamäti, že oneskorenie, ktoré produkuje, je čas útoku, "
"ktorý nastavíte."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:44
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parametre"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:50
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:51
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Hodnota"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:54
msgid "**Input gain**"
msgstr "**Vstupné zosilnenie**"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:55
#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:58
#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:61
#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:64
#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:73
msgid "Float"
msgstr "Reálne číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:56
msgid "Set input gain. Default is 1."
msgstr "Nastavuje vstupné zosilnenie. Predvolená hodnota je 1."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:57
msgid "**Output gain**"
msgstr "**Výstupné zosilnenie**"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:59
msgid "Set output gain. Default is 1."
msgstr "Nastavuje výstupné zosilnenie. Predvolená hodnota je 1."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:60
msgid "**Limit**"
msgstr "**Obmedzenie**"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:62
msgid "Do not let signals above this level pass the limiter. Default is 1."
msgstr ""
"Neprenechá signály nad touto úrovňou prejsť cez obmedzovač. Predvolená "
"hodnota je 1."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:63
msgid "**Attack**"
msgstr "**Útok**"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:65
msgid ""
"The limiter will reach its attenuation level in this amount of time in "
"milliseconds. Default is 5 milliseconds."
msgstr ""
"Obmedzovač dosiahne svoju úroveň útlmu za tento čas v milisekundách. "
"Predvolená hodnota je 5 milisekúnd."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:66
msgid "**Release**"
msgstr "**Uvoľnenie**"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:67
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Celé číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:68
msgid ""
"Come back from limiting to attenuation 1.0 in this amount of milliseconds. "
"Default is 50 milliseconds."
msgstr ""
"Návrat z obmedzovania na útlm 1.0 za tento počet milisekúnd. Predvolená "
"hodnota je 50 milisekúnd."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:69
msgid "**Enable ASC**"
msgstr "**Aktivovať ASC**"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:70
#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:76
msgid "Switch"
msgstr "Prepnúť"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:71
msgid ""
"When gain reduction is always needed ASC takes care of releasing to an "
"average reduction level rather than reaching a reduction of 0 in the release "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Keď je vždy potrebné zníženie zosilnenia, ASC sa postará o uvoľnenie na "
"priemernú úroveň zníženia namiesto dosiahnutia zníženia 0 v čase uvoľnenia."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:72
msgid "**ASC level**"
msgstr "**Úroveň ASC**"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:74
msgid ""
"Select how much the release time is affected by ASC, 0 means nearly no "
"changes in release time while 1 produces higher release times."
msgstr ""
"Nastavuje, do akej miery ASC ovplyvňuje čas uvoľnenia; 0 znamená takmer "
"žiadne zmeny v čase uvoľnenia, zatiaľ čo 1 produkuje dlhšie časy uvoľnenia."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:75
msgid "**Normalize to 0dB**"
msgstr "**Normalizovať na 0dB**"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/audio_effects/volume_and_dynamics/limiter.rst:77
msgid ""
"Auto level output signal. Default is enabled. This normalizes audio back to "
"0dB if enabled."
msgstr ""
"Automaticky nastaví úroveň výstupného signálu. Predvolene aktivované. Ak je "
"aktivované, normalizuje zvuk späť na 0dB."

